meta {
  name: Access groups - List rules
  type: http
  seq: 173
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/access-groups/<group cuid>/rules
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The entitlement keys of the sign-in provider that give members this access group (#1386, ADR 0047): "a member who holds one of these keys is in this group". Owner and admins. 404 when the instance has no provider with entitlements (OIDC_ENTITLEMENTS_URL) or the community is not listed in OIDC_ENTITLEMENT_COMMUNITIES. Token ability: groups:read.
}
